### 2.4 The Trigger

The trigger system of STAR splits into four levels, depending on the detector information used and on the corresponding time budget, i.e. trigger rate. The following section shall introduce the lowest level, STAR Level-0, which is the fastest and was used to trigger on the collision geometry and interaction location. A detailed description of the STAR trigger design and hardware for Level-0, 1 and 2 can be found in [33]. The highest level, STAR Level-3, will be described in the next chapter.

